{% comment %}
    STAFF — the staff page: its people as photo cards (Styles/_staff.scss).
    CONCEPT: the people are written out by hand (Partials/StaffConcept.lava)
    to get the design right before it's built from Rock (people, teams,
    photos).

    Block:                    an HTML block in the page's Main zone
    Block content:            {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/StaffPhotos.lava' %}
    Enabled Lava Commands:    none (for now)

    THE TEAMS
      One section per team, in the order of staffTeams, under a divider;
      people whose team isn't one of them go in a last section,
      otherTeamTitle. A team with nobody in it is left out.

    THE CARD (from the designer's concept)
      A cut-out photo standing in a panel in the person's colour (lime, sky,
      coral or sand), the head rising above the panel's top edge and the
      shoulders a little past its sides; under the photo, a deeper band (the
      panel's width) with the name in white. Under
      the card: the title, then the email.
      Hover (or keyboard focus) crossfades the everyday photo (A) to the fun
      one (B).
      The card opens the person's page (StaffDetail.lava, staffDetailUrl
      ?Staff=<key>) in a pop-up, as the group finder's cards do (theme.js
      "Frame pop-up"); the address carries ?staff=<key> while it's open.
      Ctrl/⌘-click opens the page itself. The email is its own link.
{% endcomment %}

{%- comment -%} ===== SETTINGS ===== {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign staffDetailUrl = '/page/42047' -%}{%- comment -%} PLACEHOLDER: the staff detail page; a route once it's dynamic {%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture staffJson %}{% include '~~/Assets/Lava/Partials/StaffConcept.lava' %}{% endcapture -%}
{%- assign staffList = staffJson | FromJSON -%}
{%- assign staffPhotoPath = '~~/Assets/Images/Staff_Photos/' | ResolveRockUrl -%}
{%- assign staffTeams = 'Next Gen|Facilities & Safety|Outreach|Worship Experience' -%}
{%- assign otherTeamTitle = 'More of our team' -%}{%- comment -%} PLACEHOLDER: until everyone's team is one of the four {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign teamKeys = '|' | Append:staffTeams | Append:'|' -%}
{%- assign sectionTitles = staffTeams | Append:'|' | Append:otherTeamTitle | Split:'|' -%}

<article class="content-page staff" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Article">
  <meta itemprop="headline" content="Our staff">
  <div itemprop="articleBody">

  {%- for sectionTitle in sectionTitles %}
  {%- capture sectionCards -%}
    {%- for person in staffList -%}
      {%- assign personKey = '|' | Append:person.Team | Append:'|' -%}
      {%- if teamKeys contains personKey %}{% assign personSection = person.Team %}{% else %}{% assign personSection = otherTeamTitle %}{% endif -%}
      {%- if personSection == sectionTitle %}
      <li class="staff-card" data-card data-tone="{{ person.Tone }}">
        <div class="staff-card__frame">
          <div class="staff-photo">
            <img class="staff-photo__img" src="{{ staffPhotoPath }}{{ person.Photo }}_a.webp" width="934" height="1280" alt="{{ person.Name | Escape }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <img class="staff-photo__img staff-photo__img--alt" src="{{ staffPhotoPath }}{{ person.Photo }}_b.webp" width="934" height="1280" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          </div>
          <h3 class="staff-card__name"><a href="{{ staffDetailUrl }}?Staff={{ person.Key }}" data-card-link data-staff-modal="{{ person.Key }}">{{ person.Name }}</a></h3>
        </div>
        <p class="staff-card__role">{{ person.Title }}</p>
        {%- if person.Email != '' %}
        <p class="staff-card__email"><a class="staff-card__email-link" href="mailto:{{ person.Email }}">{{ person.Email | Replace:'@','<wbr>@' }}</a></p>
        {%- endif %}
      </li>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign sectionCards = sectionCards | Trim -%}
  {%- if sectionCards != '' %}
  <section class="staff-team" aria-labelledby="staff-team-{{ forloop.index }}">
    <div class="sermons-divider"><h2 id="staff-team-{{ forloop.index }}">{{ sectionTitle }}</h2></div>
    <ul class="staff-grid">
      {{ sectionCards }}
    </ul>
  </section>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- endfor %}

  </div>
</article>
